---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import cosmosData from '../../data/cosmos.json';

const { siteConfig } = cosmosData;
---

<Layout title="Level 1 Fold 1 — The Twins Saga & SOLARA">
  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <section class="relative py-20 px-6 max-w-5xl mx-auto text-center overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 -z-10 flex items-center justify-center">
      <div class="w-[500px] h-[500px] bg-purple-600/15 rounded-full blur-3xl"></div>
      <div class="w-[300px] h-[300px] bg-amber-500/15 rounded-full blur-3xl"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="inline-flex items-center space-x-2 bg-purple-950/80 border border-purple-800/60 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-mono text-purple-300 mb-6">
      <span>🌌 LEVEL 1 &bull; FOLD 1</span>
    </div>

    <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-black tracking-tight leading-tight">
      The Twins Saga & <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-400 via-pink-400 to-purple-400 bg-clip-text text-transparent">SOLARA</span>
    </h1>

    <p class="mt-6 text-lg text-slate-300 max-w-3xl mx-auto font-light leading-relaxed">
      Level 1 – Fold 1 is the primary plane of existence where structure, identity, and systems operate in a stable, recognizable form. Governed by consistent time and predictable cause-and-effect, it acts as the ground-level reality where the grandest cosmic proxy war unfolds.
    </p>
  </section>

  <!-- Overview Box -->
  <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 mb-16">
    <div class="bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800 p-8 rounded-2xl relative overflow-hidden backdrop-blur-sm">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3 flex items-center gap-2">
        <span>🌌</span> Overview
      </h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed font-light">
        At the center of this Fold lies a <strong>300,000-year cycle enforced by The One</strong>—a cold, vast cosmic architect that repeatedly prevents the convergence of twin souls born from Father Time and Mother Fate. Spanning institutional deception, dark propaganda, time paradoxes, and tragic sacrifices, Level 1 – Fold 1 tracks the journey of two separated sisters moving toward an inevitable collision and ultimate resolution: the birth of <strong>SOLARA</strong>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Core Protagonists -->
  <section class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 py-12 border-t border-slate-900">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-8 text-center flex items-center justify-center gap-2">
      <span>👥</span> Core Protagonists
    </h2>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
      <!-- Pandora Raven -->
      <div class="bg-slate-900/90 border border-purple-900/50 p-8 rounded-2xl flex flex-col justify-between hover:border-purple-500/50 transition">
        <div>
          <div class="flex justify-between items-start mb-4">
            <span class="text-xs font-mono text-purple-400 bg-purple-950 px-2.5 py-1 rounded border border-purple-800/40">The Light Twin</span>
            <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold">Raised in Darkness</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-2">Pandora Raven</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-purple-300 font-mono mb-4">
            Public Identity: "The Witch of the South" &bull; "The Corrupt" &bull; "The Fifth Rider"
          </p>
          <div class="text-xs bg-slate-950/60 border border-slate-800 p-3 rounded-lg text-slate-300 mb-4 font-mono">
            Core Philosophy: Observe, Question, Record, Understand.
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
            <strong>The Arc:</strong> Born carrying the light (the sun's half), but taken at birth during wartime and raised in a dark monastery. Taught to believe she was a catastrophe, Pandora embraces corruption as a survival strategy, becoming a Dark Queen before realizing the system lied to her. Stripping away her titles, she learns her light was never truly destroyed, transforming into the Carrier of Light and reclaiming her identity as a Daughter of Time and Fate.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Elara Dawn -->
      <div class="bg-slate-900/90 border border-amber-900/50 p-8 rounded-2xl flex flex-col justify-between hover:border-amber-500/50 transition">
        <div>
          <div class="flex justify-between items-start mb-4">
            <span class="text-xs font-mono text-amber-400 bg-amber-950 px-2.5 py-1 rounded border border-amber-800/40">The Dark Twin</span>
            <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold">Raised in Light</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-2">Elara Dawn</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-amber-300 font-mono mb-4">
            Public Identity: "The Sun" &bull; "The Crimson Commander" &bull; "War"
          </p>
          <div class="text-xs bg-slate-950/60 border border-slate-800 p-3 rounded-lg text-slate-300 mb-4 font-mono">
            Core Philosophy: Witness, Remain, Protect, Carry, Inspire.
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
            <strong>The Arc:</strong> Born carrying darkness, but raised inside the light of Mydaal's Church and built into a living weapon. Leading the southern expedition out of Mydaal, Elara acts as the continent's shield. When her faith in the Church shatters upon discovering the deliberate separation of the twins, she hardens into War. Through time displacement and the cosmic sight of Illuminate, she rejects being a weapon, reclaiming her name to ride as Elara.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Cosmic Hierarchy -->
  <section class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 py-16 border-t border-slate-900">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-8 text-center flex items-center justify-center gap-2">
      <span>🏛️</span> Major Factions & Cosmic Hierarchy
    </h2>

    <div class="space-y-4">
      <div class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 p-5 rounded-xl flex items-start gap-4">
        <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-purple-400 bg-purple-950 px-3 py-1 rounded border border-purple-800/50 shrink-0">TIER 1</span>
        <div>
          <h4 class="text-base font-bold text-white">Initium Finis (The Cosmic Observer)</h4>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-1">Older than Time and Fate. Watches every universe attempt twin convergence without interfering, until leaning in during the current cycle to recognize the sisters.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 p-5 rounded-xl flex items-start gap-4">
        <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-purple-400 bg-purple-950 px-3 py-1 rounded border border-purple-800/50 shrink-0">TIER 2</span>
        <div>
          <h4 class="text-base font-bold text-white">The One (The Architect)</h4>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-1">The highest operational power within the system. Enforces the 300,000-year loop to prevent twin convergence and maintain system balance.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 p-5 rounded-xl flex items-start gap-4">
        <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-purple-400 bg-purple-950 px-3 py-1 rounded border border-purple-800/50 shrink-0">TIER 3</span>
        <div>
          <h4 class="text-base font-bold text-white">The Hidden Ones & The Order</h4>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-1">The ancient operatives who built the Church, engineered past wars, and split the twins at birth to turn them into opposing weapons.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 p-5 rounded-xl flex items-start gap-4">
        <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-purple-400 bg-purple-950 px-3 py-1 rounded border border-purple-800/50 shrink-0">TIER 4</span>
        <div>
          <h4 class="text-base font-bold text-white">The Lighted</h4>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-1">A 300,000-year-old secret counter-institution. Truth-preservation communities operating in the quiet places to protect genealogies, hold the door open, and aid convergence.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 p-5 rounded-xl flex items-start gap-4">
        <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-purple-400 bg-purple-950 px-3 py-1 rounded border border-purple-800/50 shrink-0">TIER 5</span>
        <div>
          <h4 class="text-base font-bold text-white">The Seven Deadly Sins & The Riders</h4>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-1">Systemic field agents and embodied distortions (headed by Valence/Pride) deployed by the Order to enforce institutional control.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Key Artifacts & Concepts -->
  <section class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 py-16 border-t border-slate-900">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-8 text-center flex items-center justify-center gap-2">
      <span>🔑</span> Key Artifacts & Concepts
    </h2>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
      <div class="bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800 p-6 rounded-xl">
        <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-amber-400 mb-2">The Inverse Twin Rule</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
          <em>"Same darkness, different choice."</em> Pandora is the Light Twin raised in darkness; Elara is the Dark Twin raised in light.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800 p-6 rounded-xl">
        <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-amber-400 mb-2">The Ring</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
          Forged by Pandora from Elara’s discarded cross, infused with her essence, and sent across time and planes to serve as an unshakeable memory bridge between the sisters.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800 p-6 rounded-xl">
        <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-amber-400 mb-2">Liber Primordius</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
          An ancient codex functioning in a closed causal loop, passed across ages by the wizard Olan Celt to preserve memory continuity across cycles.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800 p-6 rounded-xl">
        <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-amber-400 mb-2">Illuminate</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
          A grand cosmic spell cast by Pandora before temporal suspension, transferring her complete knowledge, memory, and perspective directly into Elara.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800 p-6 rounded-xl md:col-span-2">
        <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-amber-400 mb-2">Polaris & Sigma Octantis</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
          The navigational stellar anchors of the north and south. Polaris serves as Elara’s fixed star of alignment, while Sigma Octantis acts as Pandora’s cosmic seal and power source.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Destination: SOLARA -->
  <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-16 border-t border-slate-900 mb-20">
    <div class="bg-gradient-to-b from-slate-900 to-purple-950/40 border-2 border-amber-500/80 p-8 md:p-12 rounded-3xl text-center shadow-2xl shadow-purple-950/50 relative overflow-hidden">
      <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-64 h-64 bg-amber-500/10 rounded-full blur-3xl -z-10"></div>
      
      <span class="text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-widest text-amber-400 bg-amber-950 px-4 py-1 rounded-full border border-amber-800/60">
        Album 9 &bull; Post-Convergence Era
      </span>

      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-black text-white mt-6 mb-4">
        ☀️ The Ultimate Destination: SOLARA
      </h2>

      <p class="text-sm md:text-base text-slate-300 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed font-light">
        Born from the twin-flame convergence after 300,000 years of broken cycles. Her name integrates <strong>SOL</strong> (sun/solstice) + <strong>A</strong> (Elara) + <strong>RA</strong> (their shared sun god suffix). SOLARA carries the three-hundred-thousand-year legacy not as trauma or damage, but as an inheritance, marking the birth of a whole, unshakeable reality.
      </p>

      <div class="mt-8 flex justify-center gap-4">
        <a href={siteConfig.patreonUrl} target="_blank" class="bg-gradient-to-r from-purple-600 to-pink-600 hover:from-purple-500 hover:to-pink-500 text-white font-bold text-sm px-8 py-3 rounded-full transition shadow-lg hover:scale-105">
          Unlock Twins Saga Lore Vault on Patreon
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
